# Type alias with 2+ fields produces Intersection body in the type system.
# The alias can be used as a TypeAssert annotation.
# [Point: [type [x: Integer  y: Integer]]] defines a point record type.
# [@Point [x: 1  y: 2]] checks that the dict satisfies the Point type.
[
  Point: [type [x: Integer  y: Integer]]
  p: [@Point [x: 1  y: 2]]
]
=== out
["Point": []  "p": ["x": 1  "y": 2]]
